## 5. Malformed AI Responses

Tests the [extractJSON](file:///d:/ai%20code%20review/src/claude.ts#123-137) → [parseAndValidate](file:///d:/ai%20code%20review/src/claude.ts#138-166) → retry pipeline against every category of bad Claude output.

| # | Test Case | Simulated Claude Response | Expected Outcome |
|---|-----------|--------------------------|------------------|
| 5.1 | Markdown-wrapped JSON | `` ```json\n{...valid...}\n``` `` | `extractJSON` strips fences → passes |
| 5.2 | Prefixed commentary | `"Here is the review:\n{...valid...}"` | [extractJSON](file:///d:/ai%20code%20review/src/claude.ts#123-137) locates `{...}` → passes |
| 5.3 | Trailing commentary | `{...valid...}\n\nLet me know if you need more.` | [extractJSON](file:///d:/ai%20code%20review/src/claude.ts#123-137) locates `{...}` → passes |
| 5.4 | Completely empty response | `""` (empty text block) | [extractTextContent](file:///d:/ai%20code%20review/src/claude.ts#110-122) throws `EMPTY_RESPONSE` |
| 5.5 | No text block in response | Response has only `tool_use` blocks | [extractTextContent](file:///d:/ai%20code%20review/src/claude.ts#110-122) throws `EMPTY_RESPONSE` |
| 5.6 | Truncated JSON | `{"bugs":["error"],"complexity":{"time":"O(n)"` | `JSON_PARSE_ERROR` → retry → if still truncated, `VALIDATION_FAILED` |
| 5.7 | Valid JSON, wrong schema | `{"answer": "looks good"}` | `VALIDATION_FAILED` → retry → if still wrong, throws with Zod path errors |
| 5.8 | Valid JSON, partial schema | `{"bugs":[], "complexity":{...}}` (missing 3 fields) | `VALIDATION_FAILED` → retry |
| 5.9 | Double-encoded JSON | `"{\"bugs\":[],...}"` (string, not object) | `JSON.parse` returns string → Zod rejects non-object → retry |
| 5.10 | HTML response | `<html><body>Error</body></html>` | `JSON_PARSE_ERROR` → retry → `VALIDATION_FAILED` |
| 5.11 | Retry succeeds | First response invalid, second response valid | Returns valid [AIReviewResult](file:///d:/ai%20code%20review/src/claude.ts#51-63) — no error thrown |
| 5.12 | Both attempts fail | First and second responses both malformed | Throws [AIReviewError](file:///d:/ai%20code%20review/src/claude.ts#73-89) with code `VALIDATION_FAILED` and `raw` containing second response |

### Target Functions
- [extractJSON()](file:///d:/ai%20code%20review/src/claude.ts#123-137) — lines 123–136
- [extractTextContent()](file:///d:/ai%20code%20review/src/claude.ts#110-122) — lines 110–121
- [parseAndValidate()](file:///d:/ai%20code%20review/src/claude.ts#138-166) — lines 138–165
- [reviewCode()](file:///d:/ai%20code%20review/src/claude.ts#169-264) retry block — lines 220–261

